WEBVTT

00:02:28.836 --> 00:02:31.396
The author C.S. Lewis
called this state of mind

00:02:31.396 --> 00:02:34.716
"the inconsolable longing
for we know not what."

00:02:34.756 --> 00:02:37.596
And he was mesmerized by it all his life.

00:02:37.636 --> 00:02:39.476
As am I.

00:02:39.516 --> 00:02:42.276
When I was 22 years old
and I was still in law school,

00:02:42.276 --> 00:02:44.436
some friends came by my dorm room

00:02:44.436 --> 00:02:46.556
to pick me up on the way to class.

00:02:46.596 --> 00:02:49.596
And I had been sitting
and listening to bittersweet music,

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:52.356
which is something
I've been doing all my life.

00:02:53.996 --> 00:03:00.636
(Music: "Adagio in G Minor" by Albinoni)